 nt
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, please go here to COMPLETE YOUR REGISTRATION: https://gtapreneurs.c
 om/business-networking-events-mississauga\n\nJoin us for our first ever bu
 siness networking event in Mississauga. We have been hosting business netw
 orking events for 7 years with over 250 networking events and 3 business e
 xpos completed. We are proud to bring you this monthly event to help you g
 row your business.\n\n**EVENT TIME:** 5:00-8:00pm\n**VENUE:** The Donegal 
 Arms\n**ADDRESS:** 136 Lakeshore Rd E\, Mississauga\n**MENU:** [www.donega
 larms.com](www.donegalarms.com)\n\n**EVENT** **ITINERARY:**\n\n* **5:00-6:
 30pm:** Open networking (\\*Appetizers provided - Buy your own beverage)\n
 * **6:30-7:30pm:** Speed networking (Talk in pairs for 3 minutes\, then sw
 itch)\n* **7:30-8:00pm:** Open networking\n\n\\*Feel free to order dinner 
 as well. The venue will appreciate it :)\n\n**TICKETS:** $20\n\n**Hosted b
 y:**\n**Tammy Defoe\,** President and Founder\, GTApreneurs Inc.\nhttps://
 gtapreneurs.com/business-coaching-toronto\n\nView all of GTApreneurs event
 s and services at [www.gtapreneurs.com](www.gtapreneurs.com)\n\nWe look fo
 rward to seeing you there!
