SUMMARY:GTApreneurs November 24\, 2026 Vaughan Business Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, please go here to COMPLETE YOUR REGISTRATION: https://gtapreneurs.c
 om/networking-events-vaughan\n\nJoin us at an exciting Business Networking
  Event in Vaughan (1 block north of Toronto) on Tuesday November 24 where 
 you can meet potential clients and referral partners\, learn something new
 \, enjoy a meal and promote your business!\n\n* **EVENT TIME:** 5:00-8:00p
 m\n* **VENUE:** Improve Canada\, 2nd floor auditorium\n* **ADDRESS:** 7250
  Keele St\, Vaughan\, ON (Between Steeles Ave W. and 407)\n* **PARKING:** 
 Free\, onsite. Park on the NORTH SIDE of the building off of Snidercroft R
 d\n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **5:00-6:00pm:** Open networking\, food buf
 fet\, visit exhibitor booths\n* **6:00-6:10pm:** GTApreneurs welcoming pre
 sentation\n* **6:10-6:30pm:** Guest Speaker Presentation: Chris Webb\, ***
 "Your Reputation\, Their Risk."***\n* **6:30-7:00pm:** Exhibitor Introduct
 ions + member Elevator Pitches\n* **7:00-8:00pm:** Open networking\, visit
  exhibitors\n\n**TICKETS:** $25 in advance or $27 on event day\n\nNot a GT
 Apreneurs Member? Go here to view our memberships and register: https://gt
 apreneurs.com/business-networking-memberships\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVE
 NT?**\nCall or text **Tammy** at (416) 522-7770 or info@gtapreneurs.com.\n
 \nThis event will feature Guest Speaker **Chris Webb**\, CEO\, IT Works Co
 . Chris is a technology and AI strategist challenging business leaders to 
 think bigger\, move faster\, and grow. As CEO of IT Works Co and Sunshine 
 ai\, with 25+ years of experience\, he’s helping small business owners p
 rotect what’s important so they can innovate confidently.\n\nContact **C
 hris** at (416) 657-4010 and visit [www.itworksco.com](www.itworksco.com) 
 to learn more about his services.\n\n**EXHIBITORS:**\n\n* **Abhishek Basak
 **\, Clerk Tech\, www.clerk-tech.com\n* **Balbir Pabila**\, PPLSI\\~LegalS
 hield\, https://bkpabila.legalshieldassociate.com\n* **Brad Aylward**\, BH
 A Mortgage Corp. Mortgage Architects LIC # 12728\, www.bhamortgagecorp.com
 \n* **Brian Pho**\, Oasis LLP\, www.oasisllp.ca\n* **Moiz Ur Rehman**\, Al
 lstate\, www.agents.allstate.ca/on/newmarket/17725-yonge-st-n/moiz-ur-rehm
 an\n* **Robert Kennedy**\, Kennedy-Marques Real Estate Group\, [www.rjkenn
 edyrealestate.com](www.rjkennedyrealestate.com)\n* **Sonia Kurmey**\, Arbo
 nne\, www.soniakurmey.arbonne.com\n\n**\\*Want to stand out?** Visit www.g
 tapreneurs.com/exhibitor to book your exhibitor table\n\n\\*We will EMAIL 
 you the GUEST CONTACT SHEET the day after the event by 5pm. If you don’t
  receive it in your inbox\, please check your SPAM/JUNK folder. Note: You 
 must attend the event to receive the guest contact sheet.\n\n**Want 1-1 he
 lp with your business?** Learn about Tammy Defoe's business coaching servi
 ces here: https://gtapreneurs.com/about and https://gtapreneurs.com/busine
 ss-coaching-toronto
