SUMMARY:GTApreneurs December 2\, 2026 Toronto Business Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, please go here to COMPLETE YOUR REGISTRATION: https://gtapreneurs.c
 om/networking-events-toronto\n\nJoin us for a vibrant Business Networking 
 Event in Toronto where you may meet your next client or referral partner. 
 Discover opportunities and connect! Register now.\n\n* **VENUE:** The Vill
 age Hive Eglinton\n* **ADDRESS:** 120 Eglinton Ave E\, 3rd floor event spa
 ce\, Toronto\, ON\n* **TRANSIT:** Get off at Eglinton subway station\, wal
 k East down Eglinton a few minutes and you will find it on the north side 
 of the street in a tall office building\n* **PARKING:** Parking garage in 
 Loblaws building (entrance on Lilian Street)\n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* 
 **6:00-7:00pm:** Open networking\n* **7:00-7:05pm:** GTApreneurs’ presen
 tation\n* **7:05-7:15pm:** Venue Host presentation: Serene Chin\n* **7:15-
 8:00pm:** Open networking\n\n\\*Appetizers and refreshments provided.\n\n*
 *TICKETS:** $22 in advance or $25 on event day\n\n***\\*Includes a Guest C
 ontact Sheet*** emailed to you the day after the event. Note: You need to 
 attend the event to receive the sheet.\n\n**HOSTS:**\n**Tammy Defoe\,** Pr
 esident of GTApreneurs\nLearn more about Tammy’s Coaching services at ww
 w.gtapreneurs.com/business-coaching-toronto\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT
 ?** Call 416-522-7770 or email info@gtapreneurs.com\n\nand\n\n**Serene Chi
 n**\, Community Manager at The Village Hive Eglinton.\n\nSerene is the fri
 endly and dedicated Community Manager at The Village Hive’s Eglinton loc
 ation in midtown Toronto. Serene brings a wealth of experience as an entre
 preneur and mortgage broker\, along with a passion for community. She foun
 ded one of the GTA’s first dog cake bakeries\, blending her love for dog
 s with her entrepreneurial spirit. An active community leader with the Lei
 tchcroft Community Association\, Serene is always focused on building conn
 ections and supporting local businesses. Fluent in four languages and a vo
 lunteer with the Markham Dog Alliance\, she brings warmth\, enthusiasm\, a
 nd a true connector’s spirit to The Hive.\n\n**CONTACT SERENE:**\n\\(647
 \\) 500\\-0980 \\| [www.thevillagehive.ca/eglinton](www.thevillagehive.ca/
 eglinton) \\| info@eglintonhive\\.ca\n\nView all of GTApreneurs events and
  services at www.gtapreneurs.com\n\nWe look forward to seeing you there!
